  "title": "United Bank Promotes Emily Bartram to Market President of Huntington Market",
  "summary": "HUNTINGTON, WV – United Bank recently promoted Emily Bartram to market president of its Huntington Market. As market president, Bartram will lead strategic efforts to drive commercial and retail production, while ensuring the profitability and sustained growth of the market. Bartram will also play a pivotal leadership role in managing public relations efforts in Huntington, while also representing United Bank in the community through active participation in civic affairs and professional organizations.",
